msgid ""
"This slider allows you to define how fast/slow the text should be scrolled "
"when using the mousewheel."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie skuiwer laat toe jy na definieer hoe vinnige/stadige die teks moet "
"wees gerol wanneer te gebruik die muis wiel."

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "Sensitive"
