msgid "&Temporarily slowed scrolling"
msgstr "Tydelik verstadig rolling"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "Slow the scrolling down when mouse points at the scroller"
msgstr "Stadige die rolling ondertoe wanneer muis punte na die roller"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid ""
"Check this box to make KNewsTicker slow the scrolling down when you move the "
"mouse cursor over the scrolling text. This makes clicking on items and "
"dragging the icons (if enabled) away a lot easier."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie boks na maak K-nuustikker stadige die rolling ondertoe "
"wanneer jy beweeg die muis plekaanduier bo die rolling teks. hierdie maak te "
"kliek op iteme en te trek die ikoone (as geaktiveer) weg 'n baie makliker."

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "&Use custom names for news sites"
msgstr "Gebruik pasmaak name vir nuus tuistes"

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid "Use the names defined in the list of news sources"
msgstr "Gebruik die name gedefinieër in die lys van nuus bronkodes"

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"Check this box to make the news ticker use the names you specified in the "
"list of news sources (available on the tab labelled <i>News sources</i>) "
"instead of the ones the news sites themselves report."
"<br>This can be handy for news sites which report a very long or useless "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie boks na maak die nuus tikker gebruik die naam jy "
"gespesifiseer in die lys van nuus bronkodes (beskikbaar op die oortjie "
"geëtiketeer <i>nuus bronkodes</i>) in plaas van van die ene die nuus "
"tuistes hulleself raporteer."
"<br>hierdie kan wees nuttig vir nuus tuistes wat raporteer 'n baie lang of "
"nutteloos naam."

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid "News Sources"
msgstr "Nuus Bronkodes"

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "Name of Site"
msgstr "Naam van Tuiste"

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Source File"
msgstr "Bron Lêer"

#: rc.cpp:28
msgid "Max. Articles"
msgstr "Max. Aktikels"

#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "News sources to be queried"
msgstr "Nuus bronkodes na wees bevraag"

#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"This list lets you manage the list of news sites the news ticker will query "
"for headlines. The news sources are arranged in a tree-like hierarchy and "
"sorted by topic."
"<br>The column labelled \"Max. articles\" shows how many articles will be "
"cached for the news sites (read: how many articles will be accessible "
"through the context menu).<ul>\n"
"<li>To add a site, you can either drag the URL of the RDF or RSS file to "
"this list from Konqueror or any other application, or use the <i>Add...</i> "
"button in the bottom right corner.</li>\n"
"<li>To modify a site, just double-click on the particular news source you'd "
"like to edit and an input field will pop up which lets you edit the "
"respective property.</li>\n"
"<li>To remove a site, simply select a news source in the list and click on "
"the <i>Remove</i> button in the lower right corner.</li></ul>\n"
"Note that you can also right-click on the list to open a menu which lets you "
"add and remove news sources. You can also dis-/enable certain news sources "
"temporarily by (un-)checking the box next to it; those news sources whose "
"box is checked are considered activated and will be processed by KNewsTicker."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:31 rc.cpp:49
msgid "R&emove"
msgstr "Verwyder"

#: rc.cpp:32
msgid "Remove selected site"
msgstr "Verwyder gekose tuiste"

#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "Click this button to remove the currently selected news site from the list."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na verwyder die huidiglik gekose nuus tuiste van die "
"lys."

#: rc.cpp:34
msgid "Add..."
msgstr "Voeg by..."

#: rc.cpp:35
msgid "Add a new site"
msgstr "Voeg by 'n nuwe tuiste"

#: rc.cpp:36
msgid ""
"Click this button to add a new site to the list. Note that you can also drag "
"a RDF or RSS file to this list (i.e. from Konqueror) to add it to the list."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na voeg by 'n nuwe tuiste na die lys. Nota wat jy kan "
"asook trek 'n Rdf of Rss lêer na hierdie lys (i.e. van Konqueror) na voeg "
"by dit na die lys."

#: rc.cpp:37
msgid "&Modify..."
msgstr "Verander..."

#: rc.cpp:38
msgid "Modify selected news source"
msgstr "Verander gekose nuus bron"

#: rc.cpp:39
msgid ""
"Click this button to open a dialog which lets you edit the properties (such "
"as the name, the source file, or the icon) of the currently selected news "
"source."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na open 'n dialoog wat laat jy jy redigeer die "
"eienskappe (soos as die naam, die bron lêer, van die ikoon) van die "
"huidiglik gekose nuus bron."

#: rc.cpp:40
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filters"

