#: rc.cpp:78 rc.cpp:81 rc.cpp:83 rc.cpp:86
msgid "Scrolling speed"
msgstr "Rolling spoed"

#: rc.cpp:79 rc.cpp:82 rc.cpp:84 rc.cpp:87
msgid ""
"Here you can define how fast the text should be scrolling. If you only have "
"a little space on your taskbar (and therefore a rather small news ticker), "
"you should probably set this to a slower speed so that you have a chance to "
"read the headlines. For wider news tickers (and better eyes), faster "
"scrolling is probably appropriate so that you don't have to wait too long "
"for the next headline."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan definieer hoe vinnige die teks moet wees rolling. As jy slegs "
"het 'n klein spasie op jou kasbar (en daarom 'n eerder klein nuus tikker), "
"jy moet waarskynlik stel hierdie na 'n stadiger spoed sodat wat jy het 'n "
"kans na lees die hoof opskrifte. Vir wyer nuus tikkers (en beter oë), "
"vinniger rolling is waarskynlik geskikte sodat wat jy moet nie het na wag te "
"lang Vir die volgende hoof opskrif."

#: rc.cpp:80
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Vinnige"

#: rc.cpp:85
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "Stadige"

#: rc.cpp:88
msgid "Di&rection of scrolling:"
msgstr "Rigting van rolling:"

