#: rc.cpp:98
msgid ""
"These options allow you to define in what direction the text should be "
"scrolled, e.g. to the left or to the right, upwards or downwards. Rotated "
"means the text is rotated 90 degrees."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsies toelaat jy na definieer in wat rigting die teks moet wees "
"gerol, e.g. na die links of na die regterkant, boontoe of ondertoe. "
"Geroeteer beteken die teks is Geroeteer 90 grade."

