#: rc.cpp:119 rc.cpp:122
msgid "Scrolling text font"
msgstr "Rolling teks skrif tipe"

#: rc.cpp:120
msgid ""
"Click on the button at the right labeled <i>Choose Font...</i>"
" to choose the font which will be used for the scrolling text. Please note "
"that certain fonts are harder to read than others, especially when they are "
"used as scrolling text. You should probably choose a font which can be "
"easily read while it is moving."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op die knoppie na die regterkant klassifiseer <i>Kies Skrif "
"tipe...</i>"
" na Kies die Skrif tipe wat sal wees gebruik word vir die rolling teks. "
"Asseblief nota wat sekere skriftipes word harder na lees as andere, in "
"besonder wanneer hulle word gebruik word as rolling teks. Jy moet "
"waarskynlik Kies 'n Skrif tipe wat kan wees maklik lees terwyl dit is beweeg."

#: rc.cpp:121
msgid "Choose Font..."
msgstr "Kies Skrif tipe..."

#: rc.cpp:123
msgid ""
"Click here to choose the font which will be used for the scrolling text. "
"Please note that certain fonts are harder to read than others, especially "
"when they are used as a scrolling text. You should probably choose a font "
"which can be easily read while it is moving."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hier na kies die skrif tipe wat sal wees gebruik word vir die rolling "
"teks. Asseblief nota wat sekere skriftipes word harder na lees as andere, in "
"besonder wanneer hulle word gebruik word as 'n rolling teks. Jy moet "
"waarskynlik kies 'n skrif tipe wat kan wees maklik lees terwyl dit is beweeg."

#: rc.cpp:125
msgid "Scroll the most recent headlines onl&y"
msgstr "Rol die mees onlangse hoof opskrifte slegs"

#: rc.cpp:126
msgid "Show only the most recent headline for each news site in the scroller"
msgstr ""
"Vertoon slegs die mees onlangse hoof opskrif vir elke nuus tuiste in die "
"roller"

#: rc.cpp:127
msgid "Check this button to show only the most recent headline for each news site. "
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie knoppie na vertoon slegs die mees onlangse hoof opskrif vir "
"elke nuus tuiste. "

#: rc.cpp:128
msgid "Show icons"
msgstr "Vertoon ikoone"

#: rc.cpp:129
msgid "Show icons in the scrolling text"
msgstr "Vertoon ikoone in die rolling teks"

#: rc.cpp:130
msgid ""
"Click this button to make KNewsTicker show the icons of the news site to "
"which each headline belongs. This makes associating a headline to a news "
"site very easy but takes up some space in the text."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na maak K-nuustikker vertoon die ikoone van die nuus "
"tuiste na wat elke hoof opskrif behoort. hierdie maak assosiëring 'n hoof "
"opskrif na 'n nuus tuiste baie maklike maar neem begin sommige spasie in die "
"teks."

#: rc.cpp:131
msgid "&Endless scrolling"
msgstr "Eindelose rolling"

#: rc.cpp:132
msgid ""
"Make the headlines scroll continuously, instead of scrolling all of the "
"headlines and then starting again."
msgstr ""
"Maak die hoof opskrifte rol kontinu, in plaas van van rolling alle van die "
"hoof opskrifte en dan word beginne weer."

#: rc.cpp:133
msgid ""
"Check this box to avoid that ugly break at the end of the scrolling (when "
"all the headlines have appeared once). If endless scrolling is enabled, and "
"the last headline has been shown, the first headline will be attached to the "
"end of the scrolling text."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie boks na vermy wat lelik breek na die einde van die rolling "
"(wanneer alle die hoof opskrifte het verskyn as eers). As eindelose rolling "
"is geaktiveer, en die laaste hoof opskrif het al vertoon, die eerste hoof "
"opskrif sal wees gekoppelde na die einde van die rolling teks."

#: rc.cpp:134
msgid "&Underline highlighted headline"
msgstr "Onderstreep verlig hoof opskrif"

#: rc.cpp:135
msgid "Underline the currently highlighted headline"
msgstr "Onderstreep die huidiglik verlig hoof opskrif"

#: rc.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Check this box to have the currently highlighted headline (e.g. the headline "
"which is currently under the mouse cursor) underlined."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie boks na het die huidiglik verlig hoof opskrif (e.g. die "
"hoof opskrif wat is huidiglik onder die muis plekaanduier) geonderstreep."

#: rc.cpp:137
msgid "Add News Source"
msgstr "Voeg by Nuus Bron"

#: rc.cpp:138
msgid "News Source Properties"
msgstr "Nuus Bron Eienskappe"

#: rc.cpp:139
msgid "&Name:"
msgstr "Naam:"

#: rc.cpp:140 rc.cpp:142
msgid "Name of the news source"
msgstr "Naam van die nuus bron"

#: rc.cpp:141 rc.cpp:143
msgid ""
"Here you can enter the name of the news source."
"<br>Note that you can also use the button at the bottom right labelled "
"<i>Suggest</i> to let KNewsTicker fill this field automatically, after you "
"have entered a source file below."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan invoer die naam van die nuus bron."
"<br>Nota wat jy kan asook gebruik die knoppie na die bodem regterkant "
"geëtiketeer <i>Voorstel</i> na laat K-nuustikker opvul hierdie veld "
"automaties, na jy het ingevoerde 'n bron lêer onder."

#: rc.cpp:144
msgid "Source &file:"
msgstr "Bron lêer:"

#: rc.cpp:145 rc.cpp:167
msgid "The source file for this news source"
msgstr "Die bron lêer vir hierdie nuus bron"

#: rc.cpp:146 rc.cpp:168
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the source file for the news source you want to add here. "
"If you specified a source file here, you can use the button at the bottom "
"right labelled <i>Suggest</i> to let KNewsTicker fill in the remaining "
"values automatically."
msgstr ""
"Invoer die gids soeklys na die bron lêer vir die nuus bron jy wil hê na "
"voeg by hier. As jy gespesifiseer 'n bron lêer hier, jy kan gebruik die "
"knoppie na die bodem regterkant geëtiketeer <i>Voorstel</i> na laat "
"K-nuustikker opvul in die oor waardes automaties."

#: rc.cpp:147
msgid "&Icon:"
msgstr "Ikoon:"

#: rc.cpp:148 rc.cpp:150
msgid "Path to the icon for this news source"
msgstr "Gids soeklys na die ikoon vir hierdie nuus bron"

#: rc.cpp:149 rc.cpp:151
msgid ""
"Here you can specify the path to an icon to be used for this news source. "
"Icons make it easier to distinguish between multiple news sources as the "
"headlines scroll by."
"<br>Note that you can also use the button at the bottom right labelled "
"<i>Suggest</i> to let KNewsTicker fill this field automatically, after you "
"have entered a source file above."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan spesifiseer die gids soeklys na 'n ikoon na wees gebruik word "
"vir hierdie nuus bron. Ikoone maak dit makliker na onderskei tussen "
"veelvuldige nuus bronkodes as die hoof opskrifte rol deur."
"<br>Nota wat jy kan asook gebruik die knoppie na die bodem regterkant "
"geëtiketeer <i>Voorstel</i> na laat K-nuustikker opvul hierdie veld "
"automaties, na jy het ingevoerde 'n bron lêer boonste."

#: rc.cpp:152
msgid "Icon to be used for this news source"
msgstr "Ikoon na wees gebruik word vir hierdie nuus bron"

#: rc.cpp:153
msgid ""
"This is what the currently configured icon for this news source looks like. "
"To change this icon, use the input field at the left."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is wat die huidiglik gekonfigureer ikoon vir Hierdie nuus bron kyk "
"hou van. Na verander Hierdie ikoon, gebruik die invoer veld na die links."

#: rc.cpp:154
msgid "Ca&tegory:"
msgstr "Kategorie:"

#: rc.cpp:155 rc.cpp:157
msgid "Into which category does this news source belong?"
msgstr "Binnein wat kategorie doen hierdie nuus bron behoort?"

#: rc.cpp:156 rc.cpp:158
msgid ""
"Here you can specify into which category this news source belongs. Arranging "
"the news sources into categories makes it much easier to maintain large "
"lists of news sources."
"<br>Note that you can also use the button at the bottom right labelled "
"<i>Suggest</i> to let KNewsTicker fill this field automatically, after you "
"have entered a source file above."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan spesifiseer binnein wat kategorie hierdie nuus bron behoort. "
"Rangskik die nuus bronkodes binnein katagoriee maak dit baie makliker na "
"onderhou groot lyste van nuus bronkodes."
"<br>Nota wat jy kan asook gebruik die knoppie na die bodem regterkant "
"geëtiketeer <i>Voorstel</i> na laat K-nuustikker opvul hierdie veld "
"automaties, na jy het ingevoerde 'n bron lêer boonste."

#: rc.cpp:159
msgid "&Max. articles:"
msgstr "Max. aktikels:"

#: rc.cpp:160 rc.cpp:162
msgid "Maximum number of articles"
msgstr "Maksimum nommer van aktikels"

#: rc.cpp:161 rc.cpp:163
msgid ""
"This option lets you define how many articles KNewsTicker should cache for "
"this news source. This value will never be exceeded."
"<br>Note that you can also use the button at the bottom right labelled "
"<i>Suggest</i> to let KNewsTicker fill this field automatically, after you "
"have entered a source file above."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie laat jy jy definieer hoe veel aktikels K-nuustikker moet kas "
"vir Hierdie nuus bron. Hierdie waarde sal moet nooit wees oorskry."
"<br>Nota wat jy kan asook gebruik die knoppie na die bodem regterkant "
"geëtiketeer <i>Voorstel</i> na laat K-nuustikker opvul Hierdie veld "
"automaties, na jy het ingevoerde 'n bron lêer boonste."

#: rc.cpp:164
msgid "The file is a &program"
msgstr "Die lêer is 'n program"

#: rc.cpp:165
msgid "Is the specified source file a program?"
msgstr "Is die gespesifiseer bron lêer 'n program?"

#: rc.cpp:166
msgid ""
"Check this box to tell KNewsTicker that the file you specified in the above "
"input field labelled <i>Source file</i> is a program and not a RDF or RSS "
"file. KNewsTicker will then process the output (as recieved on "
"<i>stdout</i>) of that program."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie boks na vertel K-nuustikker wat die lêer jy gespesifiseer "
"in die boonste invoer veld geëtiketeer <i>Bron lêer</i> is 'n program en "
"nie 'n Rdf van Rss lêer. K-nuustikker sal dan word proses die uitset (as "
"ontvang op <i>stdout</i>) van wat program."

#: rc.cpp:170
msgid "Cancel this configuration"
msgstr "Kanseleer hierdie opstelling"

#: rc.cpp:171
msgid "Press this button to close this dialog, discarding all entered information."
msgstr ""
"Druk hierdie knoppie na maak toe hierdie dialoog, gooi weg alle ingevoerde "
"informasie."

#: rc.cpp:172
msgid "&Suggest"
msgstr "Voorstel"

#: rc.cpp:173
msgid "Suggest suitable values"
msgstr "Voorstel geskik waardes"

#: rc.cpp:174
msgid ""
"Press this button to make KNewsTicker guess more or less reasonable values "
"for some of the news properties (such as the name, icon or maximum number of "
"articles)."
"<br>Note that you have to supply a source file in order to use this function!"
msgstr ""
"Druk hierdie knoppie na maak K-nuustikker skat meer van minder redelike "
"waardes vir sommige van die nuus eienskappe (soos as die naam, ikoon van "
"maksimum nommer van aktikels)."
"<br>Nota wat jy het na verskaf 'n bron lêer in volgorde na gebruik hierdie "
"funksie!"

#: rc.cpp:176
msgid "Acknowledge these values"
msgstr "Bevestig hierdie waardes"

#: rc.cpp:177
msgid ""
"Press this button to apply the values of this dialog and return to the "
"previous configuration dialog."
msgstr ""
"Druk hierdie knoppie na wend aan die waardes van hierdie dialoog en terug na "
"die vorige opstelling dialoog."

